    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Azam Ali, Assistant Professor and Consultant Ophthalmic Surgeon of the Aga Khan University (AKUH) have introduced the state-of-the-art in Cataract surgery at the Hospital. It is the latest procedure in Cataract Surgery in the western world and now for the first time it is available in Karachi.",
